@startuml 使用案例1_1_動物列表瀏覽
title 使用案例1.1: 動物列表瀏覽流程

actor "所有使用者" as User
participant "Animals.vue" as AnimalsPage
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "MinIO" as Storage

== 1. 進入動物瀏覽頁面 ==
User -> AnimalsPage: 訪問「/animals」路由
activate AnimalsPage
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: onMounted()\n初始化篩選條件\n(filters = 預設值)
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 檢查用戶登入狀態\n(authStore.user)
note right
  預設篩選條件:
  - page = 1
  - per_page = 12
  - status = PUBLISHED (隱含)
end note

== 2. 載入動物列表 ==
AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: getAnimals(filters)
activate AnimalAPI
note right
  filters 可能包含:
  - species (物種: CAT/DOG)
  - sex (性別: MALE/FEMALE)
  - region (地區/縣市)
  - source_type (來源: shelter/personal)
  - min_age, max_age (年齡範圍，月數)
  - q (關鍵字搜尋)
  - page, per_page (分頁)
end note
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals\n?page=1&per_page=12
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 檢查 JWT Token (可選)\nverify_jwt_in_request(optional=True)
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 收集查詢參數\n(species, sex, status, region,\nsource_type, min_age, max_age, q等)
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: list_animals(filters, current_user_id)
activate AnimalService

== 3. 建立查詢條件 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 取得分頁參數\npage, per_page
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 建立查詢基礎\nquery = Animal.query.filter_by(deleted_at=None)
note right
  預設只顯示已發布動物:
  - 若無 status 參數
  - 自動設定 status = PUBLISHED
end note

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用狀態篩選\nWHERE status='PUBLISHED'

alt 有物種篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用物種條件\nAND species=:species
end

alt 有性別篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用性別條件\nAND sex=:sex
end

alt 有地區篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用地區條件\n(查詢 shelter.region 或 owner.region)
end

alt 有年齡範圍篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 計算年齡範圍\n使用出生日期反推
    note right
      資料庫實作:
      - MySQL: TIMESTAMPDIFF(MONTH, dob, CURDATE())
      - SQLite: julianday('now') - julianday(dob) / 30.44
    end note
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用年齡條件\nAND age_in_months BETWEEN :min AND :max
end

alt 有關鍵字搜尋
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用關鍵字搜尋\n(name, breed, description)
    note right
      搜尋範圍:
      - animal.name LIKE '%q%'
      - animal.breed LIKE '%q%'
      - animal.description LIKE '%q%'
    end note
end

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用排序\nORDER BY created_at DESC\n(最新上架優先)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用分頁\nLIMIT per_page OFFSET offset

== 4. 執行查詢 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalModel: query.paginate(page, per_page)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: 執行 SQL 查詢\nSELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE status='PUBLISHED'\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 12 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animals[] + 總筆數
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: pagination 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

== 5. 載入關聯資料 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 批次載入關聯資料\n(避免 N+1 查詢問題)

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 載入圖片關聯\n(images relationship)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM attachments\nWHERE animal_id IN (...)\nAND type='IMAGE'\nORDER BY display_order
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: images[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 圖片列表
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 載入送養者資訊\n(shelter/owner relationship)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM shelters\nWHERE shelter_id IN (...)
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: shelters[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id IN (...)
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: users[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 送養者資訊
deactivate AnimalModel

== 6. 檢查待審核申請 ==
loop 每個動物
    AnimalService -> AnimalModel: animal.has_pending_application()
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id = :id\nAND status IN ('PENDING', 'UNDER_REVIEW')\nLIMIT 1
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: 是否有待審核申請
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> AnimalService: has_pending_application (boolean)
    deactivate AnimalModel
end

== 7. 組裝回應資料 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 組裝分頁資訊\n{total, pages, current_page}
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 呼叫 animal.to_dict(include_relations=True)
note right
  to_dict(include_relations=True) 包含:
  - 動物基本資料 (animal_id, name, species, breed,
    color, sex, dob, age, description, status)
  - 圖片列表 (images[]: url, order, mime_type)
  - 送養者資訊 (shelter/owner: name, region, contact)
  - has_pending_application 標記 (boolean)
  - featured 特色標記 (boolean)
end note
AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: {animals[], total, page, per_page, pages}
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK\n{animals[], pagination}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> AnimalsPage: {animals[], pagination}
deactivate AnimalAPI

== 8. 渲染動物列表 ==
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: animals = response.animals
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: totalPages = response.pages
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 渲染動物卡片列表
loop 每個動物
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示動物資訊:\n- 名稱、物種、性別\n- 年齡、品種、描述
    AnimalsPage -> Storage: 透過 CDN 載入圖片\nGET image.url
    activate Storage
    Storage --> AnimalsPage: 圖片資料
    deactivate Storage
    
    alt 動物有待審核申請
        AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示「有申請中」標記
    end
end

AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示分頁控制項\n(上一頁、頁碼、下一頁)
AnimalsPage --> User: 顯示動物列表\n(預設12筆/頁)
deactivate AnimalsPage

== 9. 使用者互動操作 ==
alt 點選動物卡片
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選動物卡片
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: router.push('/animals/:id')
    AnimalsPage --> User: 導航至動物詳情頁
    note right
      進入使用案例 1.3
      動物詳情檢視
    end note
    deactivate AnimalsPage
else 點選分頁按鈕
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選下一頁/頁碼
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.page
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: 重新載入動物列表\ngetAnimals(filters)
    note right: 回到步驟 2
    deactivate AnimalsPage
else 修改篩選條件
    User -> AnimalsPage: 修改篩選條件\n(物種、性別、地區等)
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 觸發 @change 事件
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: handleSearch()\n重設 page = 1
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: 重新載入動物列表
    note right
      進入使用案例 1.2
      動物搜尋篩選
    end note
    deactivate AnimalsPage
else 輸入關鍵字搜尋
    User -> AnimalsPage: 輸入關鍵字並按 Enter
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: handleSearch()
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: getAnimals({ q: keyword })
    note right
      進入使用案例 1.2
      動物搜尋篩選
    end note
    deactivate AnimalsPage
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 動物列表已載入並顯示
  2. 僅顯示 status = PUBLISHED 的動物
  3. 支援分頁瀏覽(12筆/頁，最大100筆/頁)
  4. 圖片透過 CDN 快速載入
  5. 顯示動物基本資訊與圖片
  6. 支援多維度篩選(物種、性別、地區、來源、年齡、關鍵字)
  
  **效能優化:**
  - 使用 pagination 避免載入過多資料
  - 批次載入關聯資料避免 N+1 問題
  - 圖片使用 CDN 加速載入
  - 前端快取查詢結果
  
  **資料結構:**
  - Animal Model: ORM 物件對應資料庫表
  - Service 層處理業務邏輯
  - Blueprint 層處理 HTTP 請求
  - 使用 to_dict() 序列化資料
  
  **權限控制:**
  - 無需登入即可瀏覽
  - JWT Token 為可選(optional=True)
  - 訪客與會員看到相同列表
end note

@enduml
